### --- Variaveis ---
@base_url = http://localhost:8080
@token = SEU_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
@specialist_id = SEU_SPECIALIST_ID_AQUI
@document_id = SEU_DOCUMENT_ID_AQUI
@mcp_id = SEU_MCP_ID_AQUI
@guardrail_id = SEU_GUARDRAIL_ID_AQUI
@step_id = SEU_STEP_ID_AQUI

### =============================================
### Documentos RAG
### =============================================

### Listar documentos
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar documentos — busca
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents?search=Legislacao
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar documentos — HTMX (fragmento tabela)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents?search=Legislacao
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true

### Upload de documento (multipart)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/documents
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Legislacao Trabalhista
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="legislacao.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/legislacao.pdf
--boundary--

### Detalhe do documento
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents/{{document_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Excluir documento
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/documents/{{document_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Associacao Documentos ↔ Especialistas
### =============================================

### Listar documentos do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar documentos disponiveis para associacao
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents/available
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar documentos disponiveis — com busca
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents/available?search=Legislacao
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Associar documento(s) ao especialista
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

document_ids[]={{document_id}}

### Desassociar documento do especialista
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents/{{document_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### MCPs
### =============================================

### Listar MCPs
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar MCPs — busca
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps?search=API
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Formulario de criacao
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps/new
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Criar MCP
POST {{base_url}}/admin/mcps
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=API Processos&url=https://api.processos.com/mcp&config={"timeout": 30}&headers={"Authorization": "Bearer token123"}

### Detalhe do MCP
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps/{{mcp_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Formulario de edicao
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps/{{mcp_id}}/edit
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Editar MCP
PUT {{base_url}}/admin/mcps/{{mcp_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=API Processos v2&url=https://api.processos.com/v2/mcp&config={"timeout": 60}

### Excluir MCP
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/mcps/{{mcp_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Associacao MCPs ↔ Especialistas
### =============================================

### Listar MCPs do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/mcps
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar MCPs disponiveis
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/mcps/available
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Associar MCP(s) ao especialista
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/mcps
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

mcp_ids[]={{mcp_id}}

### Desassociar MCP do especialista
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/mcps/{{mcp_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Guardrails
### =============================================

### Listar guardrails do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/guardrails
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Criar guardrail
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/guardrails
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

type=forbidden_topics&rule=Nao falar sobre precos nem descontos&message=Nao posso informar valores

### Editar guardrail
PUT {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/guardrails/{{guardrail_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

type=scope_limit&rule=Atender apenas direito trabalhista&message=Especializado em direito trabalhista

### Toggle guardrail (ativar/desativar)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/guardrails/{{guardrail_id}}/toggle
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Excluir guardrail
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/guardrails/{{guardrail_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Passo a Passo (Steps)
### =============================================

### Listar steps do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Criar step
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=Qual o seu nome completo?&data_type=free_text&required=on&score=10

### Criar segundo step
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=Qual o numero do processo?&data_type=free_text&required=on&score=20

### Editar step
PUT {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps/{{step_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=Qual o seu nome completo e CPF?&data_type=free_text&required=on&score=15

### Mover step para cima
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps/{{step_id}}/move-up
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Mover step para baixo
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps/{{step_id}}/move-down
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Excluir step
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps/{{step_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Qualificacao por Pontuacao (Scoring)
### =============================================

### Consultar scoring do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/scoring
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Configurar threshold
PUT {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/scoring
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

threshold=70

### =============================================
### Testes OWASP
### =============================================

### A01 — Documentos sem token (401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents

### A01 — MCPs sem token (401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps

### A01 — Token de usuario comum nos documentos (403)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents
Cookie: token=TOKEN_USER_AQUI

### A01 — Token de usuario comum nos MCPs (403)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps
Cookie: token=TOKEN_USER_AQUI

### A03 — SQL Injection na busca de documentos
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents?search='+OR+1=1+--
Cookie: token={{token}}

### A03 — SQL Injection na busca de MCPs
GET {{base_url}}/admin/mcps?search='+OR+1=1+--
Cookie: token={{token}}

### A03 — XSS no nome do documento (upload)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/documents
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

<script>alert('xss')</script>
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

conteudo de teste
--boundary--

### A03 — XSS no nome do MCP
POST {{base_url}}/admin/mcps
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=<script>alert('xss')</script>&url=https://example.com

### A07 — Token invalido (401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/documents
Cookie: token=invalid.token.here
